WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.756
Narrator: 
It is the cold hand of nightfall that open
the door to our deepest fears.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.928
Narrator:
For most, it is only a creeping dread,

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:14.180
Narrator:
scratching at the corner of our mind.

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:18.810
Narrator:
But for one family in 1977’s London…

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.106
 Narrator:
dread, was just the beginning.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:26.109
 I am starting the Enfield poltergeist 
case.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:29.070
Narrator:
What you’re seeing

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:33.616
Narrator: 
Is a re-imagining of those events.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.578
Narrator:
But what you’re about to hear…

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:38.955
Narrator:
is real.

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.499
PEGGY: 
What do you want? Tell us what you want.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:44.961
(Scream)

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:46.504
That’s an 11-year old girl.

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:49.716
Narrator:
Experience the original recordings.

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:52.510
It was like someone was
knocking to come in.

00:00:53.511 --> 00:00:54.054
(Gasp)

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.180
(Knocking)

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:57.849
Narrator:
In the chilling, new, docuseries.

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:59.934
GROSSE: 
People witnessed Janet levitating.

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:00.810
(Screaming)

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:05.106
PEGGY:
I know what I experienced and I know
 that it was real.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:09.736
♪♪

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.196
(Knocking)

